{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18507","headline":"及第後酬故园亲故 · 欧阳詹","name":"及第後酬故园亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"才非天授学非师，以此成名曩岂期。\n杨叶射频因偶中，桂枝材美敢当之。\n称文作艺方慙德，相贺投篇料媿词。\n犹着褐衣何足羡，如君即是载鸣时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}